                <pb facs="0659" n="645" sameAs="frus:frus1948v06/pg645"/>

                <head>Recognition of new government</head>
                <p>[For Department of State press release of March 6 on exchange of notes that day,
                    see Department of State <hi rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, March 14, 1948,
                    page 360. For Department press release of April 23 on resignation of Siamese
                    Government on April 8 and forming of new Government, see <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >ibid.</hi>, May 23, 1948, page 686. Relevant papers on this subject may be
                    found in Department files 892.00 and 892.01.]</p>
            </div>
        </body>
